  "details": "Description\n\nall audio shuts off for me, outgoing and incoming. World sounds, voices, even my own mic. The only way for me to fix it temporarily is to reset vrchat.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIt just happens whenever I lag, happens more often in high player count worlds. Not sure if there is anything else causing it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-02_20-45-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_187b0103-5c08-47e9-a844-db31adaaa291/1/file)",
